ary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: master [134da3749], v4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (nvidia; 535.183.01) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7300HQ CPU @ 2.50GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe input method I use occasionally encounters problems when typing and switching between Chinese and English input. I usually restart the input method to make it work normally.\n\nBut after restarting, Godot cannot detect that the input method is available again. This results in being unable to input Chinese until Godot is restarted. No problem with English input.\n\nAfter restarting the input method, you will receive the following warning:\n\n```\nWARNING: Input method stopped\n     at: _xim_destroy_callback (platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp:4138)\n```\n\nWhenever you open a window or popup, you will receive the following warning:\n\n```\nWARNING: XCreateIC couldn't create wd.xic\n     at: _create_window (platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp:6308)\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a0dba77-9900-414b-a195-bf1be4cf8b04\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run the editor;\n2. Restart the input method, you will get a warning;\n3. Hover on a control and wait for a pop-up window, you will get another warning;\n4. Switch to Chinese input, can't switch.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers